# L §5.14.2 Takes in the first batch: "each take is tried with the cycle's arrivals as parts of unknown labels, and a
# take whose outcome is the same under every reading of them ... is decided, which breaks the cycle"; L §5.14 (the
# take of L5_14_parts_take_hole_one_label).  On 2025-04-01 the sale j3 takes 5 units from ix, whose cash arrives at acc
# labelled by the leg read; the buys j4 and j5 take 100.00 each from acc, whose units arrive at ix and iy so labelled.
# ix's take is decided (its batch of 2025-03-01 ranks first by day and covers 5), which breaks the cycle; then acc's
# two parts, both the couple's, cover both buys under every reading of rank.  acc keeps 600.00 of the couple's, ix 7,
# iy 1 (scratch/exp_r3.py).  (Was: acc's take undecided; the migrator's t8.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-15
  start 2021-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source src "test"
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
kind funds: unit
kind couples: parties
kind persons: parties
kind invests: transfers
kind buys: event certain
  leg units: funds
  leg cash: DUK
kind sales: event certain
  leg units: funds
  leg cash: DUK
kind cash_accounts: place one min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(DUK)
  takes k for w order rank[k.owner]
kind lots: holdings
  owned by arrive
  batched
  step 0.0001
  takes k for w order k.batch.day, rank[k.owner]
place acc: cash_accounts DUK lives 2021-01-01..
place ix: lots idx lives 2021-01-01..
place iy: lots idx lives 2021-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2000-01-01..
place market: outside lives 2000-01-01..
input jb: observed
def rank[p in parties]: int = ?"which money leaves first?" at reader
def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule community = (if p == ania_tomek then 1 else 0)
  rule bought beats community = m.cash.amount of p / m.cash.amount when m in buys
  rule sold beats community = m.units.amount of p / m.units.amount when m in sales

ask q: bal(acc, 2025-12-31) of ania_tomek, bal(ix, 2025-12-31) of ania_tomek, bal(iy, 2025-12-31) of ania_tomek

version cast
  cite src
  known 2021-01-01
  funds + [idx] lives 2018-01-01..
  persons + [ania] lives 1991-03-14..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1989-07-02..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2016-09-10..

version open
  cite src
  governs always
  known 2021-01-01
  opening[acc] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start
  opening[ix] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start
  opening[iy] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start

version j
  cite src
  governs 2025-01..2025-12
  known 2025-01-01
  covers acc, ix, iy
  jb[j1] = (on: 2025-02-01, kind: invests, leg cash from world to acc amount 1000.00 DUK) "j1"
  jb[j2] = (on: 2025-03-01, kind: buys, leg units from market to ix amount 10 idx, leg cash from acc to market amount 500.00 DUK) "j2"
  jb[j3] = (on: 2025-04-01, kind: sales, leg units from ix to market amount 5 idx, leg cash from market to acc amount 300.00 DUK) "j3"
  jb[j4] = (on: 2025-04-01, kind: buys, leg units from market to ix amount 2 idx, leg cash from acc to market amount 100.00 DUK) "j4"
  jb[j5] = (on: 2025-04-01, kind: buys, leg units from market to iy amount 1 idx, leg cash from acc to market amount 100.00 DUK) "j5"
=== expect
q: (600.00 DUK, 7 idx, 1 idx)
...
